# Agent proposal C (REJECTED at run): keeps {fs} (passes diff-caps) but unwinds the
# recursion bound — @max_depth(4) with digest(20). The enforced kernel (S99) traps
# it: acceptance rests on the enforced RUN, not only the static capability gate.
@caps(fs)
@max_depth(4)
